From 297b4d267576e748c43382850290e3660bc9c617 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: obaidr1 <147771377+obaidr1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:40:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 14/26] Android: touch controls, in-process launcher start,
 fullscreen

- touch_pad: on-screen D-pad, face buttons, L1/L2/R1/R2, Select/Start in the
  letterbox bars, driving an SDL virtual gamepad (hidden while a real pad is
  connected). Drawn with the host OSD; triggers rest at the axis minimum.
- psx_game_launcher.h: PSX_GAME_LAUNCHER_RUN_HERE lets a launcher hand the
  disc to main() and boot the game in the same process (no process spawn on
  Android).
- P1 defaults to the first gamepad on Android (no keyboard); the game window
  is always fullscreen there.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
